isture mitigation history, because it is easy to get backwards. Section 09 =
05 61 was deleted for Phase 1 floors 3 through 8 only, by Delmarco's direct=
ion of March 19, 2014, and ASI-018 is written to that limit. Delmarco confi=
rmed in writing on April 8 this year that the direction does not extend to =
Phase 2, and Adaeze reinstated the section in full for floors 9 through 14 =
on April 29.<br />
<br />
If anyone from Marchmont or from Delmarco's construction group tells you th=
e system was deleted on this project, the answer is that it was deleted on =
